sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client (Human Player)
    participant H as WebSocket Hub
    participant S as Game Session
    participant M as Monitor (Server)
    participant R as Game Runner
    participant AI as AI Controller

    Note over C, AI: Initial Connection & Setup Phase

    C->>+M: POST /api/game/create (Human vs AI)
    M-->>-C: { gameID: "xyz" }

    C->>+H: WebSocket Connect (gameID, player=0)
    H->>S: Register Client
    S-->>H: Initial State
    H-->>C: MsgTypeGameState + MsgTypeBoardState (Setup)

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note right of C: Setup Interactions
        C->>H: MsgTypeSwapPieces / MsgTypeRandomizeSetup
        H->>S: Update Setup Area
        S-->>H: Setup Updated
        H-->>C: MsgTypeBoardState
    end

    C->>H: MsgTypeStartGame
    H->>S: StartGameFromSetup()
    S->>R: Start() (Asynchronous Loop)
    S-->>H: Transition to Game
    H-->>C: MsgTypeGameState (isSetupPhase: false)

    Note over C, AI: Gameplay Loop

    loop Until Game Over
        alt Human Turn
            R->>S: Wait for Input
            S-->>H: Broadcast GameState (waitingForInput: true)
            H-->>C: MsgTypeGameState
            C->>H: MsgTypeMove {from, to}
            H->>S: SubmitMove()
            S->>R: Signal Move Received
        else AI Turn
            R->>AI: Request Move
            AI-->>R: Move Decision
        end

        R->>S: Execute Move
        S->>M: NotifyMoveExecuted()
        
        alt Combat Occurred
            M->>H: MsgTypeCombat (Reveals ranks)
            H-->>C: MsgTypeCombat
            C-->>M: MsgTypeAnimationComplete (Optional)
            M->>S: WaitForAnimationComplete (3s timeout)
        end

        M->>H: BroadcastFullState()
        H-->>C: MsgTypeGameState + MsgTypeBoardState
        M->>S: AckMoveProcessed()
        S->>R: Resume Runner
    end

    Note over C, AI: Game Over & Cleanup

    R->>S: SetWinner()
    S->>M: Game Over Detected
    M->>H: BroadcastFullState() + MsgTypeMoveHistory
    H-->>C: MsgTypeGameOver + Final History
    M->>S: Save Game to DB
    M->>H: StartGameOverCleanup (5m timer)
    
    Note right of H: After 5 minutes or disconnection
    H->>S: Stop()
    M->>M: RemoveSession(gameID)
